<h2>Songtide 1.2.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed a crash that could happen while typing in search.</li>
  <li>Taking out your AirPods pauses the music right away, without a moment of it playing from your Mac's speakers.</li>
  <li>Songs no longer sometimes show the album and cover of the song before them.</li>
  <li>The visualizer no longer shows "Starts when music plays."</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
