            <description><![CDATA[<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 13px -apple-system, sans-serif; margin: 0 4px; color: CanvasText; background: transparent; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 6px 0 8px; }
  ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
</style>
<h2>Songtide 1.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Accent color: give Songtide its own accent color in Settings › General, or keep your Mac's.</li>
  <li>Songtide now speaks 36 languages, following your Mac's language, including right-to-left languages such as Hebrew and Arabic.</li>
  <li>YouTube Music now appears in your Mac's language too. To keep your Google account's language instead, see Settings › General › YouTube Music language.</li>
  <li>Share from the ⋯ menu in the player bar opens next to it, and Stats for nerds shows a checkmark while it's on.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
