<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 13px -apple-system, sans-serif; margin: 0 4px; color: CanvasText; background: transparent; }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 6px 0 8px; }
  ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
</style>
<h2>Songtide 1.1.21</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Share what's playing: Controls › Copy Song Link (⇧⌘C) and Share Song…, also in the menu bar icon's menu.</li>
  <li>File › Open Copied Link (⇧⌘O) plays a YouTube or YouTube Music link from your clipboard.</li>
  <li>Songtide opens songtide:// links and can be controlled with AppleScript, for launchers such as Raycast and Alfred.</li>
  <li>Songtide is now open source, at github.com/dcoded-dev/songtide.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
